[{"title":"次韵范石湖田园杂兴诗六十首 冬日十二首之十一 其五十九","author":"凌云翰","text":"苍朮频烧烟雾蒸，紫藤初爇蕙兰清。\n岁除却忆升平夜，萧鼓喧喧满凤城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21085,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵范石湖田园杂兴诗六十首 冬日十二首之十二 其六十","author":"凌云翰","text":"人事匆匆岁月催，检残官历待春来。\n已闻树里琴声变，更看天边斗柄回。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21086,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"兰亭卷","author":"凌云翰","text":"字体纷纷变若云，后人惟睹永和文。\n昭陵一刻谁能学，尽道吴兴似右军。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21087,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"墨梅","author":"凌云翰","text":"客里俄惊岁又残，燕山十月雪花寒。\n江南驿使无消息，却把春光纸上看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21088,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"王太守马图","author":"凌云翰","text":"衮尘六马记唐宫，失却图中玉面骢。\n好逐劝农贤太守，东郊明日踏春风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21089,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅 其一","author":"凌云翰","text":"罗浮谁写梦中春，便觉芳香暗袭人。\n不整缟衣风外舞，水边来倩为传神。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21090,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梅 其二","author":"凌云翰","text":"蛾眉淡扫玉纤纤，碧海春浓酒正酣。\n青羽无端啼月溶，令人日夜忆江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21091,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"虎溪三笑","author":"凌云翰","text":"典午乾坤迹已陈，东林聊复避风尘。\n虎溪偶过何须笑，似笑清谈解误人。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21092,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"橐驼图","author":"凌云翰","text":"内山高并两峰寒，万里毡裘雪未乾。\n今日江南人见惯，不须常展画图看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21093,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"霜月梅","author":"凌云翰","text":"北枝消得铁心肝，却恐南枝不耐寒。\n好倩东风与吹散，只留疏影月中看。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21094,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"边伯京为瑞应宫吴提点作枯木竹石图吴之甥郑敬常得之俾题其左","author":"凌云翰","text":"瑞应宫前竹木苍，边鸾曾写赠吴刚。\n一拳怪石疑琼玉，空使诗人忆渭阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21095,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"二马图","author":"凌云翰","text":"形体支离两可怜，胸中历历旧山川。\n当时伯乐曾回顾，肯信人间有暮年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21096,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"芍药图","author":"凌云翰","text":"十载杨州锦怅遮，红红白白斗繁华。\n人生总被春瞒却，元是山中药草花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21097,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"孟得名画雪景寒鸦","author":"凌云翰","text":"飞散寒鸦不可招，数株封雪落长条。\n茅檐尽日无人到，何处高楼酒未消。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21098,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵周公辅游东阳东岘因其所述之实而赋之 其一","author":"凌云翰","text":"置守当年为罢侯，剖符皆是帝王州。\n一瓢挂在长松下，方信箕山有许由。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21099,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵周公辅游东阳东岘因其所述之实而赋之 其二","author":"凌云翰","text":"旧说东阳山水郡，邑中济济盛宾僚。\n能令百里无愁叹，未足涓埃答圣朝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21100,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题白云孙画 其一","author":"凌云翰","text":"风雨虚空不可凭，如何上下恣飞腾。\n神仙变化谁能识，笑杀终南谭景升。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21101,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"集古句题苏小小像","author":"凌云翰","text":"柳色深藏苏小家，昔年相望尚天涯。\n不知谁唱归春曲，才见开花又落花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21102,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"刘耀卿画 其一","author":"凌云翰","text":"重叠春山罨画开，柳边花底抱琴回。\n谁家庭院东风里，一片笙歌隔水来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21103,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"刘耀卿画 其二","author":"凌云翰","text":"画桥南畔藕花香，坦腹湖亭爱午凉。\n醉拍阑干因得句，不知惊去睡鸳鸯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21104,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"刘耀卿画 其三","author":"凌云翰","text":"老桂吹香袭绛袍，并将秋兴写秋毫。\n何人记得南楼夜，月过松梢一丈高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21105,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"刘耀卿画 其四","author":"凌云翰","text":"曾倚江亭看雁飞，梅花和雪亚荆扉。\n客帆自向沙头落，不是山阴兴尽归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21106,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画  其一 子陵","author":"凌云翰","text":"世祖中兴忆故人，风云不应应星辰。\n一丝九鼎关轻重，未必丹青写得真。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21107,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画  其二 巢父许由","author":"凌云翰","text":"清谈又复到巢由，洗耳元非况饮牛。\n尧舜得人天下事，画师那识帝心忧。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21108,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画  其三 仁知山水","author":"凌云翰","text":"仁知微分动静间，不师端木即师颜。\n图中隐者无名姓，乐水何妨更乐山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21109,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画  其四 渔樵闲话","author":"凌云翰","text":"渔罢樵林岂惮劳，溪头闲话偶相遭。\n会稽太守诚何事，不及严陵隐最高。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21110,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"四时花鸟图 其一 梨花白颊","author":"凌云翰","text":"溶溶院落月三更，此影如何画得成。\n一树梨花双白颊，诗人闲户作清明。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21111,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"四时花鸟图 其二 榴花绣眼","author":"凌云翰","text":"满院薰风清画迟，海榴开到过墙枝。\n美人窗下闲针线，却爱花间绣眼儿。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21112,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"四时花鸟图 其三 桂花佳雀","author":"凌云翰","text":"天香一夕满人间，佳雀飞来意自闲。\n纵使枝头风露冷，也应不是纥千山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21113,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"四时花鸟图 其四 梅花鲍老","author":"凌云翰","text":"红梅竹里报春光，双鸟依依恋夕阳。\n自有天生好毛羽，当筵舞袖错教长。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21114,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"谒仇山村墓迢和张仲举诗韵","author":"凌云翰","text":"敬吊先生落照中，纸烟销尽酒樽空。\n牛羊上垄无人管，岂为当时面发红。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21115,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其一 柳庄","author":"凌云翰","text":"绕庄都是柳，远近翠相连。\n种树思前度，飞花记此年。\n闭门时系马，攲枕忽闻蝉。\n自得陶潜趣，清风为飒然。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21116,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其二 桂林","author":"凌云翰","text":"分得岩前种，年深自作林。\n因思大廷对，何似小山吟。\n浸叶为沉水，收花当屑金。\n中秋还有约，载酒过山阴。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21117,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其三 兰渚","author":"凌云翰","text":"爱此芳洲小，渔家许卜邻。\n如何挑菜处，亦有艺兰人。\n杂佩谁相问，孤琴尔独亲。\n山阴亭子近，修褉及馀春。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21118,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其四 瓜田","author":"凌云翰","text":"瓜种阳坡下，纷披半顷田。\n杞包原有象，枣比或逄仙。\n白兔官徒援，青门地自偏。\n冰盆曾荐处，六月鉴湖船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21119,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其五 芙蓉港","author":"凌云翰","text":"芙蓉开港二，一路入红云。\n露湿光犹泫，波明影自分。\n仙人四酒棹，游女妒罗裙。\n若共荷花拨，秋风岂属君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21120,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其六 筼筜坡","author":"凌云翰","text":"旧说筼筜谷，如今别有坡。\n为怜清节好，不厌绿阴多。\n暖逼冬生笋，凉深夏近荷。\n中郎如到此，应更择良柯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21121,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其七 按鹤亭","author":"凌云翰","text":"本是青云物，依亭也是幽。\n鼓琴思魏野，相鹤记浮丘。\n三叠俄成舞，千龄或可留。\n永怀曾听处，私月故山秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21122,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鉴湖八景为周履常赋 其八 放鱼池","author":"凌云翰","text":"陶朱元有法，岛峙在陂塘。\n春雨翻萍藻，丰年梦稻粱。\n奋时须一跃，乐处永相忘。\n不是池中物，风雷起浩茫。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21123,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"刘松年诗意图","author":"凌云翰","text":"野水连村绿，云山隔岸青。\n桥低疑碍艇，树密不遮亭。\n奇字无人问，清琴只自听。\n百年栖宿意，把卷忆曾经。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21124,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"舒啸轩为陈经仲赋","author":"凌云翰","text":"何处堪舒啸，轩楹眺望间。\n清风生爽籍，皓月动空山。\n欲宄声音妙，都缘意趣闲。\n东皋伊迩地，每到即忘还。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21125,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠写真吴天碧","author":"凌云翰","text":"名士号天碧，传家由道玄。\n常于多暇日，每纵写凌烟。\n妙笔知吾子，峨冠识进贤。\n何如风雪里，著我耸吟肩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21126,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送黄允迪","author":"凌云翰","text":"青门黄氏子，雅量出奇姿。\n濯濯三春柳，汪汪万顷陂。\n霜啼惊电掣，云翼讶天垂。\n况有麟经学，何姑独抱遗。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21127,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽孔徵夫","author":"凌云翰","text":"滔滔洙泗水，一脉到西湖。\n山木符先梦，乾坤失钜儒。\n空遗重席坐，无复过庭趋。\n回首东山墓，何时一致刍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21128,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送章环","author":"凌云翰","text":"昔捧宾兴诏，归途过富春。\n慇勤寻故友，邂逅识斯人。\n黄卷方游自，青云已致身。\n世家传象笏，郇国本王臣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21129,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怡云轩为魏良赋","author":"凌云翰","text":"爱汝怡云处，同看却异情。\n应知陶弘景，不是狄怀英。\n气逐龙身远，光摇鹤发明。\n名扬亲显日，霖雨在苍生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21130,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"鸣鹤轩为徐文质赋","author":"凌云翰","text":"双唳轩前鹤，松梢更作群。\n在阴其子和，随处有人闻。\n夜警多因露，皋鸣每切云。\n从兹縻好爵，细玩易中文。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21131,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"论诗次张行中韵","author":"凌云翰","text":"开门方觅句，折简复论诗。\n每到真成趣，由来不费辞。\n艰深文浅近，臭腐化神奇。\n得失真悬绝，须劳一转移。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21132,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"双松轩为沈廉赋","author":"凌云翰","text":"双松何岁植，秀色满庭隅。\n拔地疑千尺，参天见两株。\n蓝田重作记，栗里有成图。\n门对双溪水，扁舟或可呼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21133,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悼三叔明室张氏","author":"凌云翰","text":"结发为夫妇，齐眉若主宾。\n山同黄鹤隐，书逼彩鸾真。\n兰树人皆羡，蘋蘩尔独亲。\n情伤坦臒者，临穴重沾巾。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21134,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"柯敬仲枯木竹石","author":"凌云翰","text":"欲问奎章石，无言似照头。\n竹昏虞庙晚，木落洞庭秋。\n楚客心偏苦，湘娥黛正愁。\n百年成俛仰，题画忆丹丘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21135,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪景卷","author":"凌云翰","text":"山雪大如许，能令老树低。\n仙翁双屐没，童子一琴携。\n院画留冬景，臣名识夏圭。\n免园宾客散，把卷重悽悽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21136,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送沈钦叔屯种苜蓿","author":"凌云翰","text":"苜蓿能肥马，曾闻汉苑誇。\n送迟讥艾子，见远感榴花。\n既有躬耕地，宁辞著处家。\n圣朝多雨露，不久在天涯。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21137,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题梅用张蜕庵寄杨村居韵","author":"凌云翰","text":"阳春微露痕，都在老梅根。\n冰雪好同洁，杏桃空自繁。\n吟诗扶短杖，移席了残樽。\n旧住南山下，花时不出村。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21138,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送罗宗敬","author":"凌云翰","text":"之子观光日，江山入望深。\n春秋三传学，忠孝百年心。\n群马闻空冀，孤罴见出林。\n西风黄菊酒，留别重登临。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21139,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"挽卢处士","author":"凌云翰","text":"吴山卢处士，潇洒地行仙。\n云卧怜丹壑，茶歌慕玉川。\n盖棺方事定，刻石又名传。\n清逸重题号，明经有子贤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21140,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"宋授之春山隐居图","author":"凌云翰","text":"楼倚东风外，凭高取次吟。\n柳低黄鸟近，日抚翠屏深。\n世换如收局，人亡不在琴。\n凄凉图画里，愁绝百年心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21141,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠医僧朗碧天为高子威指挥赋","author":"凌云翰","text":"师号胡为朗，碧天无点埃。\n宁知药草品，能济栋梁材。\n大道传龙树，芳名达凤台。\n从兹开寿域，雨露日边来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21142,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"槐阴书舍为四明王德修赋","author":"凌云翰","text":"问讯城东地，三槐德又新。\n谁知种树者，自是读书人。\n阴满晋公舍，芳连孟氏邻。\n象山游学处，相对碧嶙峋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21143,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"庚申岁八月十三日陪祭山川因怀诸友","author":"凌云翰","text":"山川陪祭祀，引望见江云。\n月到今宵好，秋从此日分。\n声驰黄鸟咏，梦绕白鸥群。\n谩忆岩头桂，无由折赠君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21144,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"是夜宿三一庵次俞文辅题韵","author":"凌云翰","text":"庵在色山下，依坛路稍平。\n主人多道气，留客见真情。\n天籁秋号水，星河夜入城。\n江心有明月，待得海潮生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21145,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"悼吾子行道士","author":"凌云翰","text":"布衣吾道士，举世莫能偕。\n遽作骑鲸客，空遗梦蝶斋。\n阳冰书瘦硬，方朔语诙谐。\n墓碣铭贞白，临文每怆怀。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21146,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次俞子中病起韵","author":"凌云翰","text":"桐江清隐客，头白太平时。\n每唱紫芝曲，闲临碧落碑。\n无愁何用解，示病不须医。\n恐有登高兴，先期报我知。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21147,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"拟赋野无遗贤","author":"凌云翰","text":"束帛丘园起隐沦，翩翩明诏不辞频。\n风云自合从龙虎，郊薮那能隐凤麟。\n五百馀年逢圣主，普天之下尽王臣。\n陈谟幸际唐虞世，膏泽应知及兆民。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21148,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"西湖怀古次杨彦振韵","author":"凌云翰","text":"登临长使客魂消，剩水残山阅市朝。\n柳色也知随处好，莺声不似旧时娇。\n云和冷落闲来袖，风景苍茫失画桥。\n回首故宫荒草合，欲寻前事竟寥寥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21149,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"南山飞流亭","author":"凌云翰","text":"山溜泠泠来不竭，激成飞瀑散空明。\n虹霓下饮秋无际，河漠西流夜有声。\n横剑谁思仙子过，作亭人羡老僧清。\n平生惯诵天台赋，不记香炉记赤城。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21150,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄王彦强府倅 其一","author":"凌云翰","text":"西蜀人材天下奇，使君来此济时危。\n云龙风虎王褒颂，官柳江梅杜甫诗。\n苍海只疑瞻锦水，越山浑似见峨眉。\n不才谬作兰亭客，又到君家洗砚池。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21151,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄王彦强府倅 其二","author":"凌云翰","text":"野水平桥直到门，幽居绝胜浣花村。\n半帘草色留宾客，满院书声教子孙。\n庭下甘棠阴渐密，道傍苦李寔应繁。\n自公退食多清事，剩有诗书共讨论。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21152,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄王彦强府倅 其三","author":"凌云翰","text":"日日呼奴采涧芹，柁楼晚饭愧慇勤。\n草堂不用忧春雨，尘甑应劳念史云。\n关塞巳通流马道，江湖空羡白鸥群。\n来禽青李犹堪寄，为向山阴报右军。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21153,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送清溪濂上人归金华","author":"凌云翰","text":"六年西崦闭禅扉，夜梦东阳隔翠微。\n溪柳野桃频入咏，清风明月又思归。\n案头贝叶如云积，座上天花学雨飞。\n闻道春陵周子裔，墨名终不愧儒衣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21154,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"碧梧生诗为马伯庸赋","author":"凌云翰","text":"丞相当年号碧梧，生因同姓转相呼。\n玉岗春霁鸣威凤，金井秋阴集好乌。\n琴荐虞廷应有待，圭封唐叔岂相诬。\n人材特立真如此，高拂青冥见一株。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21155,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"樵云","author":"凌云翰","text":"伐木丁丁山径通，林深长觉昼冥濛。\n栋梁自挟扶舆气，斤斧全收造化功。\n莘野谩耕十亩雨，渭川空钓一丝风。\n谁知作楫为林者，只在商岩版筑中。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":21156,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]